WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.839 --> 00:00:07.740
Sean Connery was once pulled over and fined
by a British police for speeding.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:15.770
The officer's name was Sergeant James Bond.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:21.110
The entire Super Mario Brothers game was only
40 kilobytes.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:26.760
The average console game today is over one
million times that size.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:32.240
Contrary to popular belief, the pyramids were
not built by slaves, but by well-fed, skilled

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:35.720
labourers, who were given proper housing.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:42.329
In the 2004 Harvard vs Yale American Football
game, Yale students tricked thousands of Harvard

00:00:42.329 --> 00:00:48.020
fans into holding up cards that together spelt
out “WE SUCK”.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:53.960
Google is working on a fully modular smartphone
which replaceable parts, so you can upgrade

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:59.329
and repair individual parts without ever having
to buy a new phone again.

00:00:59.329 --> 00:01:06.140
40% of humanity lives in countries where it's
illegal to be homosexual.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:11.289
Nearly 3% of the ice in Antarctic glaciers
is penguin urine.

00:01:11.289 --> 00:01:17.249
The brain of the colossal squid is doughnut
shaped and its oesophagus runs through it,

00:01:17.249 --> 00:01:21.549
therefore, if it eats something too big it
could get brain damage.

00:01:21.549 --> 00:01:27.149
Whilst British MPs are speaking in Parliament,
they are exempt from defamation laws, this

00:01:27.149 --> 00:01:32.630
allows them to insult each other in any way
they choose without legal consequence.

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:40.340
When howling together, no two wolves will
howl on the same note, instead, they harmonise

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:45.789
to create the illusion that there are more
of them than there actually are.

00:01:45.789 --> 00:01:51.270
More salt is used around the world for de-icing
roads than for human consumption.

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:57.130
During a car crash, 40% of drivers never even
hit the brakes.

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:03.210
The first ever shopping mall was in ancient
Rome, built in 100 AD, it was named Trajan's

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.210
Market.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:07.840
It was four stories tall with 150 shops and
offices.

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:15.650
At room temperature, the average air molecule
travels at the speed of a bullet from a rifle.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:22.410
Every day between 10 and 20 volcanoes are
erupting somewhere on Earth.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:33.860
If you counted for 24 hours a day, it would
take over 31,000 years to reach one trillion.

